(text "USB2 HOST2 / HOST3 — independent RK3568 root ports" (at 45 48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000142"))
(text "HOST2: R1=DM, R2=DP. HOST3: T1=DM, T2=DP. Data pairs pass through low-capacitance ESD to the Type-A receptacles." (at 45 65 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000143"))
(text "Each VBUS: TPS2553DBVR, RILIM=43.2k 1% (604.6mA typ; 544.3mA min / 673.1mA max), 100nF input, 120uF polymer + 100nF output." (at 45 78 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000144"))
(text "EN tied to VCC3V3_SYS (always enabled after main 3V3); FAULT intentionally NC. Both connector shell tabs connect to GND." (at 45 91 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000145"))
(text "PCB: route D+/D- as 90-ohm differential pairs, keep stubs short, and place ESD devices beside connectors. Budget up to 0.673A per USB2 port." (at 45 105 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000146"))
(text "HOST2" (at 45 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000147"))
(text "HOST3" (at 45 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "b4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000148"))
